{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/488e1io927a5j2nahdgr81tetay762b.mp3","text":"很高兴见到您，博士，愿光明护佑您。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/mqr1y4ljv08f2kg46xs3h5u7kd1hkzs.mp3","text":"我希望被分配到最危险的战场，这样，我和我的盾才能保护每一位战友。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/o99y3md6tla3q567wlwn0ts6klzuc55.mp3","text":"“骑士”的称号理应是荣耀的象征，却不知曾几何时，它已经被当成了商品......","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/s1f7xqapv7nfuzy5plm9xu66rrnb3yk.mp3","text":"只要光仍在指引我，残忍便不能使我屈服，暴虐也不能让我屈膝。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/qrk7lh4xc2u3cvb67gthktcp0m11kui.mp3","text":"非常感谢你，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/qjkcobrfufkywbzfljjp38lmf4qnqbn.mp3","text":"卡西米尔的骑士精神，本应是这片大地上苦难者的救星，但现在的它，已经彻底沦落为被资本肆意操弄的腐朽遗产。没有比这更耻辱的了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/lxszxoc5nbsch1ua2r0en2r0y4hztw1.mp3","text":"闪灵也是引导我前进的光芒。是的，她背负着我一直追寻的希望。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/688y02pu4tdgy7nsm6ltr5wlok3xb1r.mp3","text":"当闪灵听到罗德岛这一名字，她似乎动摇了，我却不知道她动摇的理由。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/g28zgyhaqk7wvp3bw2thd5xw0ezv6xd.mp3","text":"这被矿石病侵袭的时代，将会为罗德岛的希望之光所照耀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/ay2d5dwrn0nb3asc48fanuj33i0pdeo.mp3","text":"稍稍，享受下这短暂的休憩吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/bgt45dzxzank1tvvtthv9bsxymdo922.mp3","text":"玛嘉烈·临光，卡西米尔耀骑士......不，就让我作为一名罗德岛干员，用这面盾牌捍卫您的生命、您的荣耀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/0fkax4xj315zbe5kjibnifv28zpcqwy.mp3","text":"感谢您给予我力量。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/lnw9ff7jouqafifqf3ioxirq9iojqhu.mp3","text":"感谢你，博士。我的力量为拯救苦难而存在，是的，无论如何，我都会铭记于心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/5rjo3h74bu264709db0qi5pswm0z0la.mp3","text":"闪灵曾说过，黎明还很遥远。但我相信总有一天，我们会亲手拾取那些逝去已久的荣光。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/s6sujsoizjr21iod33o02rr6z9r42ce.mp3","text":"一切伤害，都由我来阻挡。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/9rko35y3re4h7cgj6prm6baqauzv5wi.mp3","text":"绝不辱没罗德岛之名。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/nkxqhrj56tz11lqjpjw2qsglw0m3cvh.mp3","text":"准备妥当了，出发。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/9tpkrsrmjuov36xknvmmco7fqcmxqvl.mp3","text":"荣耀必须被捍卫。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/9vyjlj11vxxfqybrn343hge18thf11z.mp3","text":"以您的名义。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/s2j8pa8o8ynkz418zdqrxhr8one05u4.mp3","text":"我将为您竭尽全力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/a5sdl2v6t2bunybyeu7mvuigkd9u3oz.mp3","text":"我来掩护。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/07/97pykq9gaslyaf0l3njhr922ow3xuf4.mp3","text":"请躲在我身后。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/aqru3f2314s95hbvtjwyqf74hwk98u3.mp3","text":"光。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/eg7zezjk49lg876c19dc2ivbz7h9i37.mp3","text":"我在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/c6beg1bq39bs7sn9xzqh43fxjy6eznb.mp3","text":"别担心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/5syppwi22y9u4lpdpcsolijua3lw513.mp3","text":"复苏吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/kjrrcie71hzfhezic5f8agoin2qyeny.mp3","text":"真正的骑士决不屈服于暴力，在这把战锤面前忏悔吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/lbn5kyqvjmlo4ca2ftc2tz2rgfc63xw.mp3","text":"向前迈进吧，总有一天，我们可以......","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/5d0sr09p22kzeh3xdg3tvrl374mbdrv.mp3","text":"真正的骑士不会追击失去战意的人，无论什么样的人，都应该给予他们重新选择的机会。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/jhsabgddlxm7mvae3ngx7nyap2cv78o.mp3","text":"别在这里放弃。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/gxinane4nr2tho248lo0gj3nrwxs3ma.mp3","text":"随便走走就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/sz2140p987gu8131kbd7b2meu5oucs7.mp3","text":"有敌人......呃，博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/mov68kyxnwnm36b14lyk4jx9u4fmnp0.mp3","text":"博士，那个......咳，我可以进来吗？听说您的办公室里，收藏了大量的书籍。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/f41ypapnbtfscgczkkmwha4lu56pj2z.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/euiikcpkcv06uz12tv1uzsetgsc8j0a.mp3","text":"今晚在大骑士领，那些竞拍到了“烟火权”的企业，会用烟花铺满整个天空；而在荒地上，贫苦的聚落会难得奢侈地烧起柴火取暖。比起让名字出现在新年的烟花里，我更高兴自己曾为人送过薪柴。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/cy9303wuyrstm04cwnxytnapzupeozr.mp3","text":"早上好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_148_nearl/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/2h7tslficin67on7l06nutdko59lce6.mp3","text":"很高兴见到您，博士，愿光明护佑您。","alt":"voice/char_148_nearl/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/lucvvy4us41dinm1saflkmv3camhirf.mp3","text":"我希望被分配到最危险的战场，这样，我和我的盾才能保护每一位战友。","alt":"voice/char_148_nearl/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/51/quvkmy4x78ssyvitjs7dg0ztbamg9d0.mp3","text":"“骑士”的称号理应是荣耀的象征，却不知曾几何时，它已经被当成了商品......","alt":"voice/char_148_nearl/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/1v513pby22fouuhvzps4yw5r07m7z9l.mp3","text":"只要光仍在指引我，残忍便不能使我屈服，暴虐也不能让我屈膝。","alt":"voice/char_148_nearl/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/fjexuevdqxnvwbgx60jqn6vq5s5cm76.mp3","text":"非常感谢你，博士。","alt":"voice/char_148_nearl/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/hjhrjhnyv3ut7mkrfgbtpkio3dxtzwn.mp3","text":"卡西米尔的骑士精神，本应是这片大地上苦难者的救星，但现在的它，已经彻底沦落为被资本肆意操弄的腐朽遗产。没有比这更耻辱的了。","alt":"voice/char_148_nearl/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/gykwg1y5cu1li2ir4w3a5e7a5hthgtx.mp3","text":"闪灵也是引导我前进的光芒。是的，她背负着我一直追寻的希望。","alt":"voice/char_148_nearl/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/61455k5sy2satdh9j4952qv5wv6v6gq.mp3","text":"当闪灵听到罗德岛这